David Arthur created KAFKA-16468:
------------------------------------

             Summary: Listener not found error in SendRPCsToBrokersEvent
                 Key: KAFKA-16468
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-16468
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Bug
          Components: controller, migration
            Reporter: David Arthur
             Fix For: 3.8.0


During the ZK to KRaft migration, the controller will send RPCs using the configured "control.plane.listener.name" or more commonly, the "inter.broker.listener.name". If a ZK broker did not register with this listener, we get a error at the time of sending the first RPC to a broker.

