Hi Andrew and all,

I looked deeper into the code [1] and it seems the Metadata class is OK =
with cluster ID changing. So I'm thinking that the rebootstrapping shoul=
dn't introduce a new failure mode here. And I should remove the mention =
of this cluster ID checks from the KIP.

Best,
Ivan

