> Currently, kafka has a default config receive.buffer.bytes=3D64k, =
which translates to SO_RCVBUF =3D 65536. As a result, the Linux kernel =
can't auto tune the receive window. This will cripple performance in =
many scenarios, especially for internet traffic.
