patch|https://lore.kernel.org/netdev/20230717152917.751987-1-edumazet@goog=
le.com/T/] that makes the initial receive window 25% instead of 50% of =
SO_RCVBUF, together with the default request.timeout.ms=3D30000, it =
causes an application-level timeout.
