Jos=C3=A9 Armando Garc=C3=ADa Sancio created KAFKA-16538:
--------------------------------------------------

             Summary: UpdateFeatures for kraft.version
                 Key: KAFKA-16538
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-16538
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Sub-task
            Reporter: Jos=C3=A9 Armando Garc=C3=ADa Sancio


Should:
 # Route request to cluster metadata kraft client.
 # KRaft leader should check the supported version of all voters and observ=
ers
 ## voter information comes from VoterSet
 ## observer information is push down to kraft by the metadata controller
 # Persist both the kraft.version and voter set in one control batch

We need to allow for the kraft.version to succeed while the metadata contro=
ller changes may fail. This is needed because there will be two batches for=
 this updates. One control record batch which includes kraft.version and vo=
ter set, and one metadata batch which includes the feature records.



