Kirk True created KAFKA-16556:
---------------------------------

             Summary: Race condition between ConsumerRebalanceListener and =
SubscriptionState
                 Key: KAFKA-16556
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-16556
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Bug
          Components: clients, consumer
    Affects Versions: 3.7.0
            Reporter: Kirk True
             Fix For: 3.8.0


There appears to be a race condition between invoking the=C2=A0{{ConsumerRe=
balanceListener}}=C2=A0callbacks on reconciliation and=C2=A0{{initWithCommi=
ttedOffsetsIfNeeded}}=C2=A0in the consumer.
=C2=A0
The membership manager adds the newly assigned partitions to the=C2=A0{{{}S=
ubscriptionState{}}}, but marks them as=C2=A0{{{}pendingOnAssignedCallback{=
}}}. Then, after the=C2=A0{{ConsumerRebalanceListener.onPartitionsAssigned(=
)}}=C2=A0completes, the membership manager will invoke=C2=A0{{enablePartiti=
onsAwaitingCallback}}=C2=A0to set all of those partitions' 'pending' flag t=
o false.
=C2=A0
During the main=C2=A0{{Consumer.poll()}}=C2=A0loop,=C2=A0{{AsyncKafkaConsum=
er}}=C2=A0may need to call=C2=A0{{initWithCommittedOffsetsIfNeeded()}}=C2=
=A0if the positions aren't already cached. Inside=C2=A0{{{}initWithCommitte=
dOffsetsIfNeeded{}}}, the consumer calls the subscription's=C2=A0{{initiali=
zingPartitions}}=C2=A0method to get a set of the partitions for which to fe=
tch their committed offsets. However,=C2=A0{{SubscriptionState.initializing=
Partitions()}}=C2=A0only returns partitions that have the=C2=A0{{pendingOnA=
ssignedCallback}}=C2=A0flag set to to false.
=C2=A0
The result is: * If the=C2=A0{{MembershipManagerImpl.assignPartitions()}} f=
uture=C2=A0 is completed on the background thread first, the 'pending' flag=
 is set to false. On the application thread, when {{SubscriptionState.initi=
alizingPartitions()}}=C2=A0is called, it returns the partition, and we fetc=
h its committed offsets
 * If instead the application thread calls=C2=A0{{SubscriptionState.initial=
izingPartitions()}}=C2=A0first, the partitions's 'pending' flag is still se=
t to false, and so the partition is omitted from the returned set. The=C2=
=A0{{updateFetchPositions()}}=C2=A0method then continues on and re-initiali=
zes the partition's fetch offset to 0.



