s?
> Happy to change it.
>
> 110. Again, consumer groups don=E2=80=99t yield that level of detail abou=
t epochs.
> The MemberDescription does include the assignment, but not the list of
> subscribed topic names.
>
> 111. I didn=E2=80=99t include GroupState in GroupListing because there=E2=
=80=99s no
> single class that includes the states of all group types.
>
> 112. I think it=E2=80=99s good practice for the API to have
> ListShareGroupOffsetSpec.
> It makes evolution and extension of the API much easier. Also, it matches
