            Reporter: Ayoub Omari


Example topology:
{code:java}
 builder
   .table("input", Consumed.`with`(Serdes.String(), Serdes.String()))
   .groupBy((key, value) =3D> new KeyValue(value, key))
   .count()
   .toStream()
   .to("output", Produced.`with`(Serdes.String(), Serdes.Long()))
 {code}
At runtime, we get the following exception=C2=A0
{code:java}
Please specify a key serde or set one through StreamsConfig#DEFAULT_KEY_SER=
DE_CLASS_CONFIG
