             Summary: No way to forward message from punctuation method in the FixedKeyProcessor
                 Key: KAFKA-16585
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-16585
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Bug
          Components: streams
