Greg Harris created KAFKA-16643:
-----------------------------------

             Summary: Add ModifierOrder checkstyle rule
                 Key: KAFKA-16643
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-16643
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Task
          Components: build
            Reporter: Greg Harris


Checkstyle offers the ModifierOrder rule: [https://checkstyle.sourceforge.io/checks/modifier/modifierorder.html] that Kafka violates in a lot of places. We should decide if this is a checkstyle rule we should be following or not, and potentially enable it moving forward.



--
